24
00:02:00,440 --> 00:02:02,890
We're so dead...

25
00:02:09,080 --> 00:02:10,050
Go higher.

26
00:02:21,720 --> 00:02:23,250
Master, it won't work !

27
00:02:23,000 --> 00:02:25,050
We're too slow, we can't dodge !

28
00:02:37,800 --> 00:02:39,330
Come with me !

29
00:03:10,160 --> 00:03:11,930
Bringing you along

30
00:03:11,920 --> 00:03:14,250
gives me more cards to play for my safety.

31
00:04:23,440 --> 00:04:25,730
Master is too generous to it

32
00:04:25,840 --> 00:04:27,850
for gathering so many underlings.

33
00:04:28,680 --> 00:04:30,050
Guard me.

34
00:04:31,240 --> 00:04:32,930
Leave it to me, Master.

35
00:04:35,360 --> 00:04:38,490
The bag of holding is no longer sealed by Divine Sense.

36
00:04:38,640 --> 00:04:40,810
That means Hunchback Meng is dead.

37
00:04:47,520 --> 00:04:48,970
Top-quality spirit stones !

38
00:05:03,560 --> 00:05:04,690
This cauldron

39
00:05:04,440 --> 00:05:07,290
was the treasure of a rank 3 country:

40
00:05:07,040 --> 00:05:08,810
the Medicine King Cauldron.

41
00:05:08,600 --> 00:05:10,730
Hunchback Meng killed its owner, took the cauldron,

42
00:05:10,680 --> 00:05:13,290
and made it his life artifact.

43
00:05:13,160 --> 00:05:15,850
He tempered it for thousands of years with his life energy

44
00:05:15,600 --> 00:05:18,210
to forge it into the Poison King Cauldron.

45
00:05:17,960 --> 00:05:20,730
Its spiritual energy is poisonous,

46
00:05:20,640 --> 00:05:24,450
that green mist can destroy Divine Sense.

47
00:05:26,200 --> 00:05:27,970
Although this treasure is dangerous,

48
00:05:28,400 --> 00:05:29,970
if I use it properly,

49
00:05:30,400 --> 00:05:32,650
it will help me leave this place safely.

50
00:06:47,920 --> 00:06:49,770
Wow !

51
00:06:49,680 --> 00:06:52,730
An artifact made from a Soul Formation's life artifact !

52
00:06:54,480 --> 00:06:55,890
Congratulations, Master.

53
00:06:56,360 --> 00:06:58,210
This poison sword

54
00:06:58,280 --> 00:07:01,130
can poison a Nascent Soul with a single hit !

55
00:07:00,920 --> 00:07:03,370
It would leave them at death's door !

56
00:07:19,600 --> 00:07:21,410
So what if it has many underlings ?

57
00:07:21,160 --> 00:07:22,650
What's so great about you ?

58
00:07:22,480 --> 00:07:24,770
I'll get some underlings very soon too !

59
00:07:36,800 --> 00:07:38,650
Check the surroundings.

60
00:07:46,600 --> 00:07:48,610
Earth Trial:

61
00:07:48,360 --> 00:07:50,250
Bridge of No Return

62
00:07:44,800 --> 00:07:55,810
Earth Trial: Bridge of No Return

I have passed through the Earth Trial and killed its king before reaching this Road of No Return. This place is very interesting, if anyone in the future sees this, then consider it fate.

Carefully ponder the meaning of 'No Return'.

63
00:07:50,360 --> 00:07:51,690
No Return ?

64
00:07:51,560 --> 00:07:55,050
Carefully ponder the meaning of 'No Return'.

65
00:07:55,040 --> 00:07:57,290
Why is there such a message here ?

66
00:08:02,360 --> 00:08:03,850
No Return...

67
00:08:04,880 --> 00:08:06,530
No Return...

68
00:08:07,440 --> 00:08:09,410
Does it mean that once you step on it,

69
00:08:09,440 --> 00:08:11,090
you cannot come back ?

70
00:08:15,200 --> 00:08:17,970
Master still values me more.

71
00:08:17,920 --> 00:08:19,170
If he didn't,

72
00:08:19,240 --> 00:08:22,090
wouldn't he let Number Two do the job ?

73
00:08:28,000 --> 00:08:28,970
Master !

74
00:08:28,720 --> 00:08:30,330
Nothing's wrong here !

75
00:08:35,400 --> 00:08:36,330
Go.

76
00:08:41,040 --> 00:08:41,970
Stop.

77
00:08:43,400 --> 00:08:44,370
Come back.

78
00:08:51,760 --> 00:08:53,370
The devil was fine

79
00:08:53,960 --> 00:08:55,730
but the beast wasn't.

80
00:08:56,520 --> 00:08:58,530
The devil is somewhat of a special entity.

81
00:08:59,200 --> 00:09:01,330
It means that every living being

82
00:09:01,080 --> 00:09:02,290
that steps on this bridge

83
00:09:02,360 --> 00:09:04,210
cannot turn back.

84
00:09:32,920 --> 00:09:34,010
They're gone ?

85
00:09:49,520 --> 00:09:51,090
A Desolate Beast !

86
00:10:19,720 --> 00:10:21,890
If it really were a Desolate Beast,

87
00:10:21,880 --> 00:10:24,130
a single breath would've blown me away

88
00:10:25,320 --> 00:10:27,410
not make my clothes flutter.

89
00:10:30,840 --> 00:10:32,170
It's an illusion.

90
00:10:35,240 --> 00:10:36,850
Tie Zhu !

91
00:10:38,560 --> 00:10:39,570
My son...

92
00:10:40,160 --> 00:10:41,530
You've lost weight...

93
00:10:41,320 --> 00:10:42,170
Father...

94
00:10:43,080 --> 00:10:43,930
Mother...

95
00:10:44,120 --> 00:10:45,370
Dear,

96
00:10:45,480 --> 00:10:48,090
didn’t we bring something for Tie Zhu ?

97
00:10:48,520 --> 00:10:49,930
Tie Zhu,

98
00:10:49,680 --> 00:10:51,730
Mother brought your favorite spiced beef.

99
00:10:52,320 --> 00:10:53,590
My son,

100
00:10:53,360 --> 00:10:55,210
come and take it !

101
00:10:55,120 --> 00:10:56,170
Right,

102
00:10:56,320 --> 00:10:59,810
didn't you love your mom's spiced beef ?

103
00:11:00,120 --> 00:11:01,370
An illusion...

104
00:11:02,640 --> 00:11:04,050
This is an illusion.

105
00:11:07,440 --> 00:11:09,930
Wang Lin dared to kill my grandson

106
00:11:10,680 --> 00:11:12,930
so I'll exterminate his entire family !

107
00:11:17,960 --> 00:11:19,010
Tie Zhu...

108
00:11:19,320 --> 00:11:20,970
Save your father !

109
00:11:21,000 --> 00:11:21,770
Tie Zhu !

110
00:11:21,520 --> 00:11:24,330
Why won't you turn around to save us ?

111
00:11:25,720 --> 00:11:28,370
Turn around and look at your mother.

112
00:11:28,120 --> 00:11:30,250
How could you be so heartless ?

113
00:11:30,320 --> 00:11:32,490
Why don't you turn your head ?

114
00:11:32,320 --> 00:11:33,530
Tie Zhu !

115
00:11:35,120 --> 00:11:38,090
I crushed the Divine Sense Bead you gave us,

116
00:11:38,040 --> 00:11:39,850
come back now !

117
00:11:41,560 --> 00:11:42,770
Tie Zhu...

118
00:11:51,600 --> 00:11:55,490
Even facing death, my parents never crushed the Divine Sense Bead.

119
00:11:53,840 --> 00:11:55,090
Tie Zhu...

120
00:11:55,360 --> 00:11:56,410
I beg you !

121
00:11:56,160 --> 00:11:57,730
They're not my parents.

122
00:11:58,680 --> 00:12:01,370
Father and Mother protected me until the end.

123
00:12:01,680 --> 00:12:04,330
Why would they make me turn back here now ?

124
00:12:04,800 --> 00:12:05,890
I beg you !!!

125
00:12:05,640 --> 00:12:07,370
It's an illusion.

126
00:12:08,640 --> 00:12:10,530
This is all an illusion !

127
00:12:19,840 --> 00:12:22,410
The Bridge of No Return was very dangerous...

128
00:12:45,640 --> 00:12:46,930
Go.

129
00:12:58,480 --> 00:13:00,290
This is a restriction !

130
00:13:12,400 --> 00:13:14,850
This restriction is very powerful.

131
00:13:28,320 --> 00:13:29,530
Could it be...

132
00:13:31,920 --> 00:13:34,730
that this place is covered in restrictions ?

133
00:13:35,440 --> 00:13:37,330
This is a restriction mountain !

134
00:13:38,560 --> 00:13:40,330
It seems this second trial

135
00:13:40,080 --> 00:13:42,530
requires me to climb this restriction mountain

136
00:13:42,280 --> 00:13:44,170
to the summit.

137
00:13:45,880 --> 00:13:47,610
Master, over here !

138
00:13:50,760 --> 00:13:52,930
Someone was here before me !

139
00:13:58,120 --> 00:14:00,170
You're lucky for having me

140
00:14:00,400 --> 00:14:02,970
protect you all the way up here.

141
00:14:31,960 --> 00:14:34,370
The core of this Ancient God's restriction

142
00:14:34,120 --> 00:14:36,130
is indeed beautiful.

143
00:15:08,480 --> 00:15:09,530
Master,

144
00:15:09,920 --> 00:15:11,890
Yi'er did not fail you.

145
00:15:11,760 --> 00:15:13,450
I diligently studied restrictions

146
00:15:13,200 --> 00:15:15,370
during the past 1000 years.

147
00:15:15,000 --> 00:15:20,210
1000 years ago

148
00:15:19,560 --> 00:15:20,610
Yi'er,

149
00:15:21,240 --> 00:15:22,850
watch carefully.

150
00:15:33,600 --> 00:15:35,290
This is a restriction.

151
00:15:35,960 --> 00:15:37,090
The second trial

152
00:15:37,120 --> 00:15:39,170
is called Restriction Mountain.

153
00:15:39,440 --> 00:15:42,170
The mountain is covered in restrictions.

154
00:15:44,680 --> 00:15:45,730
Master,

155
00:15:46,200 --> 00:15:47,370
this restriction

156
00:15:47,800 --> 00:15:50,290
looks somewhat similar to a formation.

157
00:15:50,320 --> 00:15:51,370
Correct.

158
00:15:52,160 --> 00:15:54,330
A restriction is a type of formation

159
00:15:54,960 --> 00:15:57,170
but way more flexible.

160
00:15:57,400 --> 00:15:59,850
They can bend according to the cultivator's will

161
00:15:59,600 --> 00:16:01,410
in an infinite number of ways.

162
00:16:01,160 --> 00:16:04,010
Restrictions are more like Divine Sense in a way.

163
00:16:04,760 --> 00:16:07,050
A powerful cultivator can place restrictions

164
00:16:07,160 --> 00:16:09,130
just with their Divine Sense.

165
00:16:09,200 --> 00:16:11,090
As long as that Divine Sense remains,

166
00:16:11,160 --> 00:16:14,330
the restriction will continue to operate.

167
00:16:15,800 --> 00:16:18,490
The simplest way to break a restriction

168
00:16:18,400 --> 00:16:20,370
is to use brute force.

169
00:16:21,000 --> 00:16:23,890
But this method requires having a high cultivation.

170
00:16:24,120 --> 00:16:26,090
The higher you climb,

171
00:16:25,960 --> 00:16:28,370
the more complex and powerful

172
00:16:29,320 --> 00:16:31,290
the restrictions become.

173
00:16:32,080 --> 00:16:34,330
The second method to break restrictions

174
00:16:34,320 --> 00:16:35,850
is to study them.

175
00:16:36,560 --> 00:16:39,890
Once you understand the principles and rules

176
00:16:39,640 --> 00:16:41,810
of how a restriction operates,

177
00:16:42,560 --> 00:16:45,370
you can naturally break it.

178
00:16:45,360 --> 00:16:46,410
Master,

179
00:16:46,960 --> 00:16:48,930
disciple will definitely realize

180
00:16:48,840 --> 00:16:51,090
your unfulfilled dream.

181
00:17:08,120 --> 00:17:10,250
Since I modified the restrictions,

182
00:17:10,680 --> 00:17:12,250
no one

183
00:17:12,000 --> 00:17:14,170
will be able to follow us.

184
00:17:49,350 --> 00:17:56,480
Count the specks of time

185
00:17:53,230 --> 00:17:56,480
floating down gently.

186
00:17:56,590 --> 00:18:02,720
The carving knife in your hands etches out destiny.

187
00:18:03,590 --> 00:18:10,240
Forever lock away the scars

188
00:18:07,390 --> 00:18:10,240
of this mortal life.

189
00:18:10,250 --> 00:18:16,760
This fleeting youth is a thing of the past.

190
00:18:17,150 --> 00:18:24,480
The flying bird could not escape the twilight

191
00:18:19,830 --> 00:18:24,480
that fills the sky with a myriad of colors.

192
00:18:24,310 --> 00:18:31,640
The night-blooming flower cannot drink

193
00:18:26,350 --> 00:18:31,640
the crystalization of the golden wind and the jade dew.

194
00:18:31,830 --> 00:18:34,160
I will ask the heavens who exactly

195
00:18:33,910 --> 00:18:38,920
sliced open this world

196
00:18:35,310 --> 00:18:38,920
to let the rain fall in.

197
00:18:38,670 --> 00:18:40,920
I will refine the world

198
00:18:40,750 --> 00:18:43,440
to make our palm lines say

199
00:18:43,390 --> 00:18:45,800
that we will live forever.

200
00:18:45,550 --> 00:18:48,720
Walking off the beaten path

201
00:18:48,470 --> 00:18:51,800
through heaven and earth.

202
00:18:52,830 --> 00:18:58,760
Before returning to dust,

203
00:18:54,750 --> 00:18:58,760
I will refine this mortal body.

204
00:19:00,030 --> 00:19:07,640
The left shore is the joyous laughter

205
00:19:03,910 --> 00:19:07,640
that can brighten up a thousand years of sadness.

206
00:19:07,390 --> 00:19:14,240
The right shore is an eternal silence

207
00:19:08,990 --> 00:19:14,240
lingering under the candlelight.

208
00:19:14,190 --> 00:19:17,120
To overturn this fate,

209
00:19:16,870 --> 00:19:21,480
I will walk against the heavens.

210
00:19:21,670 --> 00:19:28,640
I will even gather the clouds

211
00:19:24,190 --> 00:19:28,640
to illuminate the sky for you.

212
00:19:28,790 --> 00:19:32,880
All this sadness was not meaningless.

213
00:19:32,630 --> 00:19:36,200
How many lives and deaths
have passed in the blink of an eye ?

214
00:19:35,950 --> 00:19:42,000
I vow to break

215
00:19:38,190 --> 00:19:42,000
this chess game of fate.

216
00:19:43,070 --> 00:19:52,960
I vow to break

217
00:19:44,870 --> 00:19:52,960
this chess game of fate.
